Description: Leave Me Alone (LMA) - A simple utility for core isolation in cgroup v2.
 LMA is a command-line utility designed to easily manage CPU core isolation 
 using the cgroup v2 mechanism. It helps dedicated high-priority processes 
 by confining other processes to specific sets of CPU cores, minimizing noise.